flowchart LR
    T[Task] --> H[Hypothesis]
    H --> S[Strategy]
    S --> I[Implementation]
    I --> X[Restricted Execution]
    X --> V[Independent Evaluation]
    V --> Q[Critique]
    Q --> M[Memory / Store]
    M --> D{Decision}
    D -->|verified| W[Verified Result]
    D -->|rejected| F[Failure Record]
